New: Subdecks – in Edit Deck, switch off parts of a deck you don't want to learn right now. Your progress is kept.
New: When an online deck replaces decks you already have, merge them with one tap, keep your learning progress and choose the subdecks to learn.
New: Decks can bring their learning mode, name type and review mode; you can pick them right when creating a deck or importing one from text or a QR code, and the online list shows them before you import.
